#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Cryptomator (encrypt before the cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator creates encrypted vaults that live inside your normal cloud\n"
"folders. Your files are encrypted on your machine first, so Google, "
"Dropbox,\n"
"or anyone else only ever stores scrambled data. You hold the only key.\n"
"From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Cryptomator (criptografar antes da nuvem)\n"
"\n"
"O Cryptomator cria cofres criptografados que ficam dentro das suas pastas de "
"nuvem\n"
"de sempre. Seus arquivos são criptografados primeiro na sua máquina, então o "
"Google,\n"
"a Dropbox ou qualquer outro só chega a guardar dados embaralhados. A única "
"chave é\n"
"sua.\n"
"Do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:19
msgid "Install Cryptomator now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Cryptomator agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:29
msgid "Cryptomator installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O Cryptomator foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:10
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic is a free, open-source launcher for your Epic Games, GOG, and Amazon\n"
"Prime Gaming libraries, with Proton/Wine built in. It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"O Heroic é um lançador livre e de código aberto para suas bibliotecas da "
"Epic Games,\n"
"GOG e Amazon Prime Gaming, com Proton/Wine embutido. Instala a partir do "
"Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:16
msgid "Install Heroic now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Heroic agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:26
msgid "Heroic installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O Heroic foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Joplin (notes that stay yours)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin keeps notes, notebooks, and to-dos in plain Markdown on YOUR disk.\n"
"No account required, works fully offline, and if you ever want sync it's\n"
"end-to-end encrypted — to a folder, Syncthing, or your own server.\n"
"The private alternative to OneNote and Notion. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Joplin (notas que continuam suas)\n"
"\n"
"O Joplin guarda notas, cadernos e tarefas em Markdown simples no SEU disco.\n"
"Não exige conta, funciona totalmente offline e, se um dia você quiser "
"sincronizar,\n"
"é com criptografia de ponta a ponta — para uma pasta, o Syncthing ou seu "
"próprio\n"
"servidor.\n"
"A alternativa privada ao OneNote e ao Notion. Do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:19
msgid "Install Joplin now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Joplin agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:29
msgid "Joplin installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O Joplin foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install LocalSend (share files, privately)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend sends files and messages straight between your devices on the "
"same\n"
"network — phone, laptop, desktop — with no account, no cloud, and nothing\n"
"leaving your network. It's the private alternative to AirDrop. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o LocalSend (compartilhar arquivos, com privacidade)\n"
"\n"
"O LocalSend envia arquivos e mensagens direto entre seus dispositivos na "
"mesma rede\n"
"— celular, notebook, desktop — sem conta, sem nuvem e sem nada sair da sua "
"rede.\n"
"É a alternativa privada ao AirDrop. Do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:18
msgid "Install LocalSend now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o LocalSend agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:29
msgid "LocalSend installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O LocalSend foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:30
msgid "Install it on your phone too (same name) and they'll find each other."
msgstr ""
"Instale também no seu celular (mesmo nome) e os dispositivos vão se "
"encontrar sozinhos."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ONLYOFFICE", "LibreOffice", "Word", "Excel", "PowerPoint" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:13
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ONLYOFFICE (the familiar Office look)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an open-source office suite with the ribbon\n"
"layout Microsoft Office users already know, and excellent compatibility\n"
"with Word/Excel/PowerPoint files. It runs alongside LibreOffice — keep\n"
"whichever feels right (or both). From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o ONLYOFFICE (a cara conhecida do Office)\n"
"\n"
"O ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors é um pacote de escritório de código aberto com "
"a faixa\n"
"de opções que quem usa Microsoft Office já conhece, e ótima compatibilidade "
"com\n"
"arquivos do Word/Excel/PowerPoint. Ele convive com o LibreOffice — fique com "
"o que\n"
"for melhor para você (ou com os dois). Do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:21
msgid "Install ONLYOFFICE now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o ONLYOFFICE agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:31
msgid "ONLYOFFICE installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O ONLYOFFICE foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ProtonUp-Qt", "Proton-GE", "Wine-GE", "Steam", "Lutris" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:12
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt is a free, open-source app for installing and switching between\n"
"Proton-GE and Wine-GE versions for Steam and Lutris — no terminal needed.\n"
"It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"O ProtonUp-Qt é um aplicativo livre e de código aberto para instalar e "
"alternar\n"
"entre versões do Proton-GE e do Wine-GE para Steam e Lutris — sem terminal.\n"
"Instala a partir do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:19
msgid "Install ProtonUp-Qt now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o ProtonUp-Qt agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:29
msgid "ProtonUp-Qt installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O ProtonUp-Qt foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are COMMANDS the owner types verbatim
#. into a terminal — cd, unzip, sudo and the file names must not be translated
#. or reflowed, or the instructions stop working. The last paragraph is a
#. LICENCE statement (Blackmagic forbids redistribution, which is why Dagric
#. does not bundle Resolve); keep that meaning exact. "DaVinci Resolve",
#. "Blackmagic", "NVIDIA" and "Dagric" are names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-resolve:17
msgid ""
"DaVinci Resolve on Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visit  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (opening it in your browser now if possible...)\n"
"2. Click \"Free Download\", pick the Linux version, and register.\n"
"3. Unzip the download, then run the installer:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. NVIDIA users: run  sudo dagric-drivers  first — Resolve on Linux\n"
"   performs best with the proprietary driver.\n"
"\n"
"Why isn't it preinstalled? Blackmagic's license forbids redistribution.\n"
"Any OS that bundles it is violating that license — Dagric won't."
msgstr ""
"DaVinci Resolve no Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Acesse  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (abrindo no seu navegador agora, se for possível...)\n"
"2. Clique em \"Free Download\", escolha a versão para Linux e cadastre-se.\n"
"3. Descompacte o download e execute o instalador:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. Usuários de NVIDIA: rode antes  sudo dagric-drivers  — no Linux o\n"
"   Resolve tem melhor desempenho com o driver proprietário.\n"
"\n"
"Por que não vem pré-instalado? A licença da Blackmagic proíbe a "
"redistribuição.\n"
"Qualquer sistema que o inclua está violando essa licença — o Dagric não faz "
"isso."

#. TRANSLATORS: this paragraph explains a LICENCE position — Dagric does not
#. bundle Steam because Valve's licence forbids it. Keep that meaning exact;
#. it is the reason the helper exists. "Steam" and "Valve" are product names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:16
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam is Valve's proprietary game store and launcher. Dagric doesn't ship "
"it\n"
"preinstalled (its licence forbids anyone bundling it), but installing it is "
"one\n"
"step. Everything it depends on is already set up on Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"You'll be asked for your administrator password, then Steam downloads and\n"
"installs. Afterwards, launch \"Steam\" from the application launcher."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Steam\n"
"\n"
"O Steam é a loja e o lançador de jogos proprietários da Valve. O Dagric não "
"o entrega\n"
"pré-instalado (a licença dele proíbe qualquer um de incluí-lo), mas instalar "
"é um\n"
"passo só. Tudo de que ele depende já está pronto no Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"Sua senha de administrador será solicitada e então o Steam será baixado e "
"instalado.\n"
"Depois, abra o \"Steam\" pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:26
msgid "Install Steam now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Steam agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:39
msgid ""
"Steam installed. Launch it from the application launcher; on first\n"
"run it finishes updating itself."
msgstr ""
"O Steam foi instalado. Abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos; na primeira\n"
"execução ele termina de se atualizar."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:46
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Steam installation did not complete (exit $RC). You can retry from\n"
"the Dagric Hub, or check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"A instalação do Steam não foi concluída (código de saída $RC). Você pode "
"tentar de\n"
"novo pelo Dagric Hub ou verificar sua conexão de rede."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Upscayl (AI image upscaler, offline)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl enlarges and sharpens photos and artwork using AI that runs locally "
"on\n"
"your machine — nothing is uploaded. Great for rescuing small or old images.\n"
"A capable GPU helps but isn't required. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Upscayl (ampliação de imagens com IA, offline)\n"
"\n"
"O Upscayl amplia e dá nitidez a fotos e ilustrações usando IA que roda "
"localmente na\n"
"sua máquina — nada é enviado para a internet. Ótimo para salvar imagens "
"pequenas ou\n"
"antigas. Uma boa placa de vídeo ajuda, mas não é obrigatória. Do Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:18
msgid "Install Upscayl now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Upscayl agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:28
msgid "Upscayl installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O Upscayl foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two bullet points are a PRIVACY disclosure — Variety can
#. fetch wallpapers from third-party websites, and that is why Dagric does not
#. preinstall it. Keep both the fact and the "OFF until you enable it" caveat.
#. "Slideshow" and "Configure Desktop and Wallpaper" are labels the owner has
#. to find in Plasma, so use the wording Plasma itself uses in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:20
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Variety (automatic wallpaper changer)\n"
"\n"
"Variety changes your wallpaper on a schedule, from your own folders and,\n"
"if you switch it on, from online collections. It adds a tray icon for\n"
"skipping, pausing and favouriting the current image.\n"
"\n"
"Two things worth knowing before you install:\n"
"  * Variety can download wallpapers from third-party websites. That is\n"
"    OFF until you enable a source, but it is why Dagric doesn't preinstall "
"it.\n"
"  * If you only want a rotating slideshow of your OWN pictures, you don't\n"
"    need this at all — right-click the desktop, Configure Desktop and\n"
"    Wallpaper, and choose \"Slideshow\".\n"
"\n"
"Installed from the system's own repositories (GPL-3, open source), about 25 "
"MB\n"
"its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — instalar o Variety (troca automática de papel de parede)\n"
"\n"
"O Variety troca seu papel de parede em intervalos definidos, a partir das "
"suas\n"
"próprias pastas e, se você ligar, de coleções online. Ele adiciona um ícone "
"na área\n"
"de notificação para pular, pausar e favoritar a imagem atual.\n"
"\n"
"Duas coisas que vale saber antes de instalar:\n"
"  * O Variety pode baixar papéis de parede de sites de terceiros. Isso fica\n"
"    DESLIGADO até você habilitar uma fonte, mas é por isso que o Dagric não "
"o\n"
"    deixa pré-instalado.\n"
"  * Se você só quer uma apresentação girando as SUAS próprias fotos, não "
"precisa\n"
"    disso — clique com o botão direito na área de trabalho, \"Configurar "
"área de\n"
"    trabalho e papel de parede\" e escolha \"Apresentação de slides\".\n"
"\n"
"Instalado a partir dos repositórios do sistema (GPL-3, código aberto), cerca "
"de 25 MB\n"
"com as dependências."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:37
msgid "Install Variety now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Instalar o Variety agora? [s/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:46
msgid "Variety installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "O Variety foi instalado — abra-o pelo menu de aplicativos."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:47
msgid "It starts in the system tray; right-click the icon for options."
msgstr ""
"Ele inicia na área de notificação; clique com o botão direito no ícone para "
"ver as opções."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:61
msgid ""
"To rotate the wallpapers already on this computer, open\n"
"Variety's preferences, go to Images, choose Add and then Folder, and pick:\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/share/wallpapers\n"
"\n"
"That is the thirty-four Dagric packs, and every KDE wallpaper besides. A\n"
"folder source works entirely offline — nothing is downloaded and no website\n"
"is contacted."
msgstr ""

